# JS Code Quality (Classic ASPX)

`00-core-fsm` (anti-overengineering / anti-sycophancy) နဲ့ `14-security-appsec` လိုက်နာ။  
**`01-react-standards` / React/Next MUST rules** ကို ဤ tree မှာ **မသက်ဆိုင်**။

---

## Mindsets (စိတ်ထား)

- Simplicity · readability · maintainability — premature micro-opts ထက်
- Less code = less debt
- **Minimal diffs** — task သက်ဆိုင်ရာသာ; drive-by cleanup **မလုပ်**

---

## Naming (အမည်ပေးခြင်း)

- `camelCase` functions/vars
- `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` module constants
- Units in names (`timeoutMs`)
- Collections = plural; booleans = questions (`isLoaded`, `hasError`)
- Event handlers = `handle*`
- vague names **မသုံး:** `d`, `tmp`, `obj`, `x`, `data` (domain name သိရင်)

---

## Guidelines (လမ်းညွှန်)

- Early returns — deep nesting ထက်
- Small pure helpers — sprawling functions ထက်
- DRY — duplication **real and stable** ဖြစ်မှ
- Rejected promises handle (`await` / `.catch` / intentional `void` + why)
- `fetch` မှာ `res.ok` **စစ်**

---

## Globals (ASPX-safe)

- ad-hoc `window.*` ထက် IIFE / one namespaced object **prefer**
- secrets ကို `window` **NEVER** stash
- SharePoint host globals — task မလိုရ unless ထိ

---

## Comments

- **English only** (`00` Language) — non-English တွေ့ရင် rewrite
- WHY only; workarounds = reason + date

---

## Reject (မလုပ်ရ)

- library အသစ် approval မရှိဘဲ ထည့်
- classic controller JS → React/SPFx **convert** (classic tree ထဲ)
- `eval` / unsafe `innerHTML` with user data (`14-security-appsec`)
